{"id":"23442ad478f1b29e","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-ATR.md","title":"Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion Schema","display":"df-ATR — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-ATR","aliases":["62-df-ATR"],"display":"df-ATR — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion Schema","depends_on":["[[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]","[[62-df-WellOrder]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.11.1, V.2.2–V.2.4","source_pages":[39,174,175],"source_pdf_pages":[57,192,193]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-ATR"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-ATR</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ATR — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c50226ab37e9ce8\" href=\"?note=0c50226ab37e9ce8\" title=\"62-df-recursion-hierarchy\">62-df-recursion-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"649faa9c6d69237b\" href=\"?note=649faa9c6d69237b\" title=\"62-df-WellOrder\">62-df-WellOrder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.11.1, V.2.2–V.2.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>174</span><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span><span>192</span><span>193</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf H_\\theta\">\\(\\mathsf H_\\theta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c50226ab37e9ce8\" href=\"?note=0c50226ab37e9ce8\" title=\"62-df-recursion-hierarchy\">62-df-recursion-hierarchy</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"649faa9c6d69237b\" href=\"?note=649faa9c6d69237b\" title=\"62-df-WellOrder\">62-df-WellOrder</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>；UC 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ATR}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\to\\exists H\\;\\mathsf H_\\theta(W,R,H;\\bar u,\\bar A)):\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ATR}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\to\\exists H\\;\\mathsf H_\\theta(W,R,H;\\bar u,\\bar A)):\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>H 是一套编码所有阶段的单个集合；递归可以读取全部严格前驱阶段。WO 是内部良序公式。模式的存在性不是在元理论中做一次外部递归后自动获得；这正是新增公理的内容。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.11.1, V.2.2–V.2.4；纸面页 39, 174, 175；PDF 页 57, 192, 193。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-recursion-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"0c50226ab37e9ce8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WellOrder","status":"resolved","id":"649faa9c6d69237b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WellOrder]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-recursion-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"0c50226ab37e9ce8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)$ 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC 见 [[62-df-L2]]。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WellOrder","status":"resolved","id":"649faa9c6d69237b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)$ 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC 见 [[62-df-L2]]。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)$ 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC 见 [[62-df-L2]]。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)$ 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC 见 [[62-df-L2]]。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf H_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ATR}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\to\\exists H\\;\\mathsf H_\\theta(W,R,H;\\bar u,\\bar A)):\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]，$\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ATR]]；$\\mathrm{ATR}_0$ 在下式引入。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR|Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion Schema]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR]]"}],"outgoing":["0c50226ab37e9ce8","649faa9c6d69237b","8535a715d3193fba","4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}